{"id":"644321","name":"自制黑豆腐","author":"清水淡竹","authorId":"8451954","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/644321/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"黑豆","amount":"60g"},{"name":"黑芝麻","amount":"20g"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"4个"}],"sub":[{"name":"水","amount":"700ml"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"鸡蛋、黑豆、黑芝麻。","img":"images/644321/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"黑豆、黑芝麻清洗浸泡。","img":"images/644321/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放入破壁机中打成豆浆。","img":"images/644321/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"鸡蛋打散。","img":"images/644321/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"打好的豆浆，已经很细腻了就没有再过滤。","img":"images/644321/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"冷却的豆浆倒入蛋液中，加盐拌匀。","img":"images/644321/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"搅拌好的豆浆蛋液。","img":"images/644321/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"保鲜盒铺一层油纸，倒入豆浆蛋液。","img":"images/644321/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"上锅蒸，水开上汽后蒸20分钟。","img":"images/644321/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"倒出冷却。","img":"images/644321/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"切块。","img":"images/644321/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/644321/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：破壁机、蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}